# Signing material, at any depth. android/.gitignore already covers the app
# directory, but the keytool command in docs/STORE-LISTING.md is run from
# wherever you happen to be standing, and a signing key committed to a public
# repository cannot be un-published.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.jks.b64
keystore.properties
